<section class="av_textblock_section av-m4h81onp-b3a5d0a13a5f155a5cfb6df70a178676" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p style="text-align: center;">This treatment delivers pure oxygen in a pressurized chamber, where the air pressure is raised 2–3 times above normal levels. This process helps your lungs take in much more oxygen than under standard conditions.</p>
