<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5khzhj2-e173d580c832b11e72652d064bfd9639" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p style="text-align: left;">Hyperbaric oxygen therapy is generally safe, but as with any medical procedure, it carries some risks. These are rare but may include:</p>
<ul style="text-align: left;">
<li><strong>Ear Barotrauma:</strong> Damage to the middle ear or eardrum due to air pressure changes.</li>
<li><strong>Temporary Vision Changes:</strong> Nearsightedness caused by shifts in the eye lens.</li>
<li><strong>Lung Barotrauma:</strong> Air pressure changes may lead to lung collapse in extremely rare cases.</li>
<li><strong>Oxygen Toxicity:</strong> Seizures caused by excessive oxygen in the central nervous system.</li>
<li><strong>Low Blood Sugar:</strong> Insulin-treated diabetics may experience drops in glucose levels.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;">Your healthcare team will ensure you are well-prepared and monitored during treatment to minimize these risks. Have additional concerns? <a href="contact-us.php">Reach out today</a>, our team of hyperbaric chamber Miami care experts will answer any questions you may have.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column_table av-l5hh8-9bedc75055cdb5c8b115c5ce85ebe548 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-l5hh8-9bedc75055cdb5c8b115c5ce85ebe548 av_one_half avia-builder-el-27 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m5kvrb8s-7eac7faef10570c5f6c7f144df86acbe av-special-heading-h3 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-28 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Preparing for <br/>Your HBOT Session</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-hlc1w-387503bc34da87a404ab6dd0e2d2b8c7" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p style="text-align: left;">To ensure safety and comfort during therapy:</p>
<ol style="text-align: left;">
<li>Wear the provided robe in place of regular clothing.</li>
<li>Avoid bringing items like lighters or battery-powered devices into the chamber.</li>
<li>Remove petroleum-based skincare and hair products, which are potential fire hazards.</li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: left;">The <a href="<?php echo $basePath; ?>index.php">medical concierge care</a> team at <a href="<?php echo $basePath; ?>index.php">Casa Privée</a> will guide you through all necessary preparations. <a href="contact-us.php">Schedule a consultation</a> to discover why we are the best solution for HBOT Miami has available.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-851a4-2fbe3743efdbfdf45b5650d09f7b083e av_one_half avia-builder-el-30 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-xxtyv-7fd6ba9d347b9964e139ae2564189044 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-31 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Preparing for hyperbaric oxygen treatment, Miami, Florida. Hyperbaric oxygen therapy in Miami at Casa Privée." class="wp-image-878 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-878 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="768" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hbot-003.jpg" srcset="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hbot-003.jpg 1024w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hbot-003-300x225.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hbot-003-768x576.jpg 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hbot-003-705x529.jpg 705w" title="Prepare" width="1024"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --></div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-1o7j3f-bac83867af30059c03fe07a0aeb35225 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-32 el_after_av_section el_before_av_one_full avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_5"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-868"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-1lboo3-cbbf32c610451a83aca28b003a672956 sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-1lboo3-cbbf32c610451a83aca28b003a672956 av_one_full avia-builder-el-33 el_before_av_one_full avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="av-special-heading av-m4ecgs9e-540a3d7c6250bc62225e7d236d93990a av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-34 el_before_av_hr avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">What to Expect During and After HBOT</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<div class="hr av-m4ed3dni-4dc507e40356add87c04b24836808c8b hr-invisible avia-builder-el-35 el_after_av_heading el_before_av_textblock"><span class="hr-inner"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m4eci7u5-7a7bebce483444e2f3cfc4e5dd8419b3" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p style="text-align: center;">During your session, the air pressure in the chamber will feel similar to being in an airplane or at a high elevation, causing a temporary fullness in your ears. This can be relieved by swallowing or yawning.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">After the treatment, your medical team will assess you by checking your ears, blood pressure, and pulse. For those with diabetes, glucose levels will also be monitored. While you may feel slightly hungry or tired post-session, you can typically resume your normal activities right away.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Searching for Hyperbaric Chamber Therapy near me? Give us a call today.</strong></em></p>
